@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - VerifyFrontendIncrement
actor "Engineering contributor" as actor
box "Frontend - Acceptance application" #E0F2FE
 participant "FeaturePageObject" as page
 participant "MockApiRoutes" as mock
end box
box "Backend - Acceptance test host" #D1FADF
 participant "Product controller" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
 participant "Product handler" as handler
end box
box "Backend - Test infrastructure" #FFF4E5
 database "IStudioStore fake" as db
 participant "CoverageRecord" as coverage
end box
actor -> page : Run AC scenario with missing UI behavior
page -> mock : UI issues API request
mock --> page : Controlled response or failure
page --> actor : Failing assertion (red)
actor -> actor : Implement smallest missing behavior
actor -> page : Repeat same Page Object scenario
page --> actor : Passing result (green)
actor -> coverage : Record frontend evidence and existing test link
coverage --> actor : Coverage status and remaining gap
note over page, coverage
L2-038, L2-039, L2-040, L2-041, L2-042, L2-043, L2-044, L2-045, L2-049, L2-050, L2-051, L2-052, L2-053, L2-054, L2-068
Missing mock isolation, stale test link, or UI failure: criterion remains unaccepted
end note
@enduml
